stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Routed: a tag, a DM or chatter opens it<br/>(mentionedBy = the sender)
    [*] --> Held: a bind opens it<br/>(mentionedBy = boundBy = the binder)

    Routed --> Held: any bind by hand<br/>(boundBy = tool, home, cli or router)
    Held --> Held: another bind by hand<br/>(boundBy = the latest binder)
    Held --> Routed: a tag takes the thread from a session<br/>or its specialist is gone and routing rebinds it<br/>(boundBy cleared)

    Routed --> [*]: evicted (table full, quiet an hour, nothing owed)<br/>or idle a week
    Held --> [*]: unbound, idle a week,<br/>or its session thread stays vacant

    note right of Held
        Never evicted.
        tool and home count toward TOOL_BIND_MAX.
        router hand-offs count toward ROUTER_BIND_MAX.
    end note
    note left of Routed
        boundBy absent.
        Eviction is exactly: not held.
    end note
